{"output":"I’ll inspect ownership checks and lock renewal, make a focused source fix, then build and run the regression tests with Node 24.\n\nThe Lua scripts check whether a lock exists but fail to compare its token, allowing a stale worker to delete or replace another owner’s lock. I’ll restore token checks, preserve the administrative token-0 bypass, and move retry-side promotion after validation so rejected retries emit no events.\n\nRestored lock-token validation for completion, failure, retries, and renewal. Rejected retries no longer trigger delayed-job promotion. Preserved administrative bypasses. Added four recovery regression tests.\n\nNode 24 verification passed (exit 0):\nnpm run build\nnode node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run --no-file-parallelism tests/ownership.redis.test.ts tests/worker.test.ts tests/job.test.ts tests/worker.redis.test.ts tests/concurrency.test.ts tests/stalled_jobs.test.ts tests/lock_manager.test.ts tests/job.redis.test.ts\ngit diff --check\n\n272 tests passed. No blockers.","final_output":"Restored lock-token validation for completion, failure, retries, and renewal. Rejected retries no longer trigger delayed-job promotion. Preserved administrative bypasses. Added four recovery regression tests.\n\nNode 24 verification passed (exit 0):\nnpm run build\nnode node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run --no-file-parallelism tests/ownership.redis.test.ts tests/worker.test.ts tests/job.test.ts tests/worker.redis.test.ts tests/concurrency.test.ts tests/stalled_jobs.test.ts tests/lock_manager.test.ts tests/job.redis.test.ts\ngit diff --check\n\n272 tests passed. No blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":26,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; node --version; ls; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-bullmq-G7VJT5/5-handwork/repo","exit_code":0